<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head><title>Mini IdG — MVC Client</title></head>
<body style="font-family: sans-serif; max-width: 480px; margin: 4rem auto;">
  <h2>Mini IdG — Sample MVC Client</h2>
  <p>This page is public — no login required to see it.</p>
  <p><a href="/Home/Secure">Go to the secure page</a> (this will trigger a login with no tenant hint).</p>
  <p>
    Or log in as a specific tenant (sets <code>acr_values=tenant:&lt;name&gt;</code> before
    redirecting — see <code>HomeController.LoginAsTenant()</code>):
  </p>
  <p>
    <a href="/Home/LoginAsTenant?tenant=acme">Log in as Acme Corp</a>
    (try <code>alice</code>/<code>alice</code>, or the ExternalIdp button)
  </p>
  <p>
    <a href="/Home/LoginAsTenant?tenant=globex">Log in as Globex Corporation</a>
    (try <code>bob</code>/<code>bob</code> — or try <code>alice</code>/<code>alice</code> here to see the rejection)
  </p>
</body>
</html>
